# Running the Project

Feature Engineering:

```bash
python src/phase12_features.py
```

Train Models:

```bash
python src/train_lightgbm.py

python src/train_catboost.py

python src/train_xgboost.py
```

Create Ensembles:

```bash
python src/ensemble.py

python src/triple_ensemble.py

python src/stacking.py
```

Final submission file:

```text
outputs/submissions/final_triple_ensemble.csv
```

---

# Conclusion

This solution combines extensive feature engineering with multiple gradient boosting algorithms and advanced ensemble techniques. By leveraging LightGBM, CatBoost, XGBoost, weighted averaging, and stacking, the model effectively captures temporal, spatial, and environmental traffic patterns to achieve strong predictive performance.

The final submission is generated using the stacking framework, which produced the best validation performance among all tested approaches.